kground_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk50/shows/3e6d5c8c-59b5-4c66-a4a2-e98fb3d63e8f.jpg","likes":55,"dislikes":1,"views":9032,"release_date":"1381449600000","length":7112,"description":"In the city of Verona, two families have a prolonged and ancient feud. The Montagues and the Capulets co-exist under the stern eye of the Prince, but the hatred between the families threatens all, in particular the children. The young men of both families are hot-blooded and ready to fight at any provocation, despite the Prince's edict against such fights. But when young Romeo, a Montague, first sets eyes on the virginal Capulet daughter Juliet, no enmity between families can prevent his falling in love with her, and her with him. From this risk-laden romance comes both joy and tragedy for all.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":5.8}],"value":5.8,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":10753,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}